# Allowlist: nothing is tracked unless named here. The vendor SDK, the model
# weights, build trees and downloaded corpora all stay local -- sdk/ in
# particular holds Kunlunxin's EULA'd userspace and 136 MB of prebuilt .ko
# blobs that must not end up in this repo.
/*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSES.md
!PORTING.md
!LLAMA-BUILD-NOTES.md
!INT4-FEASIBILITY.md
!QUALITY-RESULTS.md
!MULTI-CARD.md
!build.sh
!check-no-hw.sh
!check-hw.sh
!env.sh
!byte-map.csv
!driver/
!patches/
!quality/
!dual-die/

# Within those, keep build output and bulk data out.
quality/data/
quality/smoke/
dual-die/dual-die-bench
dual-die/dual-die-bench-fake
**/*.bin
**/*.err
**/*.o
**/*.ko

# Kbuild byproducts, from building the modules in place.
**/.*.cmd
**/*.mod
**/*.mod.c
**/.tmp_versions/
driver/kunlun_module/Module.symvers
driver/kunlun_module/modules.order
driver/kunlun_module/conftest/
driver/kunlun_module/kunlun/port/nv_compiler.h
